        <PageFooterBand2 Ref="12" type="PageFooterBand" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0,18.9,7.5,1</ClientRectangle>
          <Components isList="true" count="5">
            <Text51 Ref="13" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0,0.4,7.5,0.4</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,6,Regular,Point,False,0</Font>
              <Guid>4c8ae62900fd4af8a85059831cb2a1ae</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text51</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="12" />
              <Text>Items/goods covered in this invoice are received in good condition. This invoice is payable in Davao City on demand unless otherwise specified. Finance chage of 2% per month shall be added on to overdue balances in case of litigation, the buyer expressly agrrees that any legal action arising cut of this invoice may be instituted by the seller in the courts of the City of Davao and that the buyer agrees to pay at least 25% of the attorney's fees in case of litigation. All returns must be requested within 15 days of purchase by the customer. All terms and conditions deemed final after the lapse of said return period. All damaged items must be returned within the date of delivery. This invoice is not to be issued to NON-VAT-Exempt Sale of goods, properties or services. If issued, sales shall be subjected to VAT.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
            </Text51>
            <Text63 Ref="14" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0,0.2,7.5,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,6</Font>
              <Guid>ad2be30f756c4ce48539661efc035ef0</Guid>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text63</Name>
              <Page isRef="6" />
              <Parent isRef="12" />
              <Text>1. Prices are subject to change without prior notice. Please ask for provisional or official receipt as proof of payment. 2. This invoice does not serve as proof of payment. 3. Purchase returns will be accepted four (4) months from date of purchase. 4. Provincial Order Cut Off Time: 3:00pm.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
            </Text63>
