              <Text>Items  not  currently  available  are  placed  on  BACKORDER. Backordered  items  will  be automatically served  to  you  if  said  items  arrive  in  our warehouse(s)  on  or  before  the  backorder  cancellation  period. Should  you  want  to  cancel/modify/extend  the  backorder(s),  please  let us know through our sales desk at 0917-701-1883 or trunkline 082-227-4313/ 15. Thank you. </Text>
